message: Cite this software release using the metadata below. The DOI identifies software,
  not the manuscript.
type: software
title: 'Neural topic measurements in diabetic foot ulcer research: analysis software'
authors:
- family-names: Fu
  given-names: Zeyu
version: 0.4.2
license: MIT
abstract: Analysis software for a patient-level audit of fibroblast measurements from
  a frozen 15-topic logistic-normal expression model in diabetic foot ulcer research.
  It evaluates score decomposition, whole-count-pipeline sensitivity, author-mapped
  patient contrasts, paired anatomy and external tissue-context projections. Healing
  inference involves 11 patients; outcome intervals include zero and the external
  cohorts do not supply independent healing validation. This is a measurement audit,
  not a validated prognostic tool.
repository-code: https://github.com/PeterPonyu/wound-measurement-construct
keywords:
- single-cell transcriptomics
- wound healing
- measurement validity
